			"notes": "This release is a potentially breaking release that contains many important internal changes to the codebase. Existing users will likely not benefit from updating, but mod developers should keep these changes in mind for the future.\n\nNo breaking changes are included in this mod, but users may need to install the latest version of the Architectury API to update.\n\n# Additions\n- Added a dependency on the latest version of the Architectury API on both modloaders.\n\n# Changes\n- Updated the mod project to use Architectury to support both NeoForge and Fabric.\n    - Moving forward, the mod will officially be updated for NeoForge and Fabric. \n    - Currently, all support Minecraft versions (1.20.1 and 1.20.4) will have releases for both modloaders. However, I will not be releasing for NeoForge on 1.20.1 because MidnightLib only supports the old Forge on 1.20.1.\n- Temporarily removed the enchanted book work order for librarian villagers. This trade is currently broken, but it will be re-added once the underlying bug (#4) is addressed.\n- Updated the mod's namespace to `gay.skyebound.work_orders`. This change only affects developers of other mods, not players."
		},
