			"notes": "This update primarily ports this mod from NeoForge to Fabric as part of my effort to consolidate all of my mods to Fabric. From now on, all development will continue on Fabric, and support will not be given to new bugs in the NeoForge version. However, I intend to port this mod backwards to 1.20.1 (if possible) and forwards to 1.21.1 so that NeoForge users can use this mod with [Sinytra Connector](https://modrinth.com/mod/connector).\n\n# Changes\n- Ported the mod from NeoForge to Fabric.\n- Fixed a typo in the included datapack that prevented butcher villager trades from loading."
